<%- include("./partials/header.ejs") %>

<div class="info-page">
    <div class="stars"></div>
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row mb-5">
            <div class="col-12 text-center">
                <h1 class="page-title mb-3">About the International Space Station</h1>
                <p class="page-subtitle">Humanity's home in space</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <div class="info-icon">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M8 0a8 8 0 1 0 0 16A8 8 0 0 0 8 0ZM7.5 4.5a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1 .5.5 0 0 1 0 1ZM11 8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="info-card-title">Overview</h3>
                    <p class="info-card-text">
                        The International Space Station (ISS) is a modular space station in low Earth orbit. 
                        It is a multinational collaborative project involving five participating space agencies: 
                        NASA (United States), Roscosmos (Russia), JAXA (Japan), ESA (Europe), and CSA (Canada).
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <div class="info-icon">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M8 15A7 7 0 1 1 8 1a7 7 0 0 1 0 14zm0 1A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16z"/>
                            <path d="M7.5 7.5A.5.5 0 0 1 8 7h1a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5H8a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5v-2z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="info-card-title">Specifications</h3>
                    <ul class="info-list">
                        <li><strong>Mass:</strong> ~450,000 kg (990,000 lbs)</li>
                        <li><strong>Length:</strong> 73 m (239 ft)</li>
                        <li><strong>Width:</strong> 109 m (356 ft)</li>
                        <li><strong>Altitude:</strong> ~408 km (254 miles)</li>
                        <li><strong>Speed:</strong> 7.66 km/s (17,500 mph)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <div class="info-icon">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M8 0a8 8 0 1 0 0 16A8 8 0 0 0 8 0ZM1.5 8a6.5 6.5 0 1 1 13 0 6.5 6.5 0 0 1-13 0Z"/>
                            <path d="M8 11a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="info-card-title">Orbital Characteristics</h3>
                    <ul class="info-list">
                        <li><strong>Orbital Period:</strong> ~92 minutes</li>
                        <li><strong>Orbits per Day:</strong> ~15.5</li>
                        <li><strong>Inclination:</strong> 51.6°</li>
                        <li><strong>Orbital Decay:</strong> ~2 km/month</li>
                        <li><strong>Reboost Frequency:</strong> Monthly</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <div class="info-icon">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M8 16A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16zm.93-9.412-1 4.705c-.07.34.029.533.304.533.194 0 .487-.07.686-.246l-.088.416c-.287.346-.92.598-1.465.598-.703 0-1.002-.422-.808-1.319l.738-3.468c.064-.293.006-.399-.287-.47l-.451-.081.082-.381 2.29-.287zM8 5.5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="info-card-title">Research & Purpose</h3>
                    <p class="info-card-text">
                        The ISS serves as a microgravity and space environment research laboratory where scientific 
                        research is conducted in astrobiology, astronomy, meteorology, physics, and other fields. 
                        It's also used for testing spacecraft systems and equipment required for missions to the Moon and Mars.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="timeline-card">
                    <h3 class="timeline-title">Key Milestones</h3>
                    <div class="timeline">
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-year">1998</div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <h4>First Module Launched</h4>
                                <p>Zarya module launched, marking the beginning of ISS assembly.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-year">2000</div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <h4>First Crew Arrived</h4>
                                <p>Expedition 1 crew arrived, beginning continuous human presence in space.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-year">2011</div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <h4>Assembly Complete</h4>
                                <p>Final major pressurized module installed, completing the station's assembly.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mt-5">
            <div class="col-12 text-center">
                <a class="btn btn-iss-primary btn-lg" href="/map">
                    Track ISS Location
                    <svg class="ms-2" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h11.793l-3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 0 1 .708-.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L13.293 8.5H1.5A.5.5 0 0 1 1 8z"/>
                    </svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<%- include("./partials/footer.ejs") %>
